BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-
 content/uploads/2026/07/Launch-Kit-Pokemon-Mini-Con.png
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07
 /Launch-Kit-Pokemon-Mini-Con.png
UID:np0Yr2PN8Lt0KxRMjE6U3
SUMMARY:Pokemon Mini Con
DTSTAMP:20260818T032834Z
DTSTART:20260822T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:Pokémon Mini Con – Pick Your Starter\, Start Your Adventure\nAs
	k ten Pokémon fans how they got started and you’ll hear ten different answ
	ers. It might have been opening a Game Boy for the first time. Or racing h
	ome to watch the anime after school. Maybe it was pulling a favorite card 
	from a pack and carrying it everywhere for months. Pokémon Mini Con is all
	 about those moments! \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n📅 August 22\, 2026 | 1
	0AM – 5PM\n📍 9700 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036\n🎟️ FREE Entry 
	+ FREE Parking  \n  \n🔥 Event Highlights 🔥 \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n🛍️ P
	okémon Marketplace\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe marketplace floor at Pokém
	on Mini Con feels a lot like stepping into the tall grass on Route 1. Ever
	y booth brings a new encounter\, with cards to chase\, collectibles to dis
	cover\, and hidden gems waiting to be found. You never know when you’ll ru
	n into the piece that completes your collection or the find you didn’t kno
	w you needed. \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n🦹‍♂️ Pokémon Cosplay Showcase | 3
	PM -4PM\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSuit up\, Trainers! Transform into your f
	avorite Pokémon characters or Gym Leaders and show off your moves in our c
	osplay showcase. ✨ Hosted by @ShinpaiBunny ✨ Check in by 2:30PM\, the show
	case kicks off at 3PM sharp. \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n🎨 Pokémon Face 
	Painting and Hair Braids – Both Days\nChoose your favorite Pokémon\, show 
	off your team spirit\, and add a little extra magic to your day with face 
	painting starting at $6 and braids ranging from $3-20 (based on complexity
	) ✨ Hosted by @voilslinda and @will.and.whimsy \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\
	n\n🖼️ Pokémon Community Canvas- Both Days\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAdd your artis
	tic inspiration to our one-of-a-kind Pokemon Community Canvas! Draw your f
	avorite Pokémon\, sketch a Poké Ball in your own style or add an inspired 
	message to fellow fans. No professional experience required\, all artists 
	welcome! Make your mark and create something beautiful together as a fando
	m. \n  \n⚡ Be a Vendor \nNew encounter unlocked: Pokémon Mini Con vendor a
	pplications are open! If you specialize in cards\, collectibles\, artwork\
	, or all things Pokémon\, we want you to be part of the adventure. → https
	://tinyurl.com/CCSGuestVendorFromHouston \n  \n🌊 Calling all Pokémon Fans\
	n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nEvery great Trainer needs the right team. We’re looking
	 for collaborators ready to join the journey to the Elite Four. \n\n\n\n\n
	\n\n\n\n\n\n🕹️ Activity Hosts → https://forms.gle/74Qvuv9PFzeDVF1V8\n\n\n\n
	\n\n\n\n\n🎤 Workshops & Panels → https://forms.gle/cdpspG6VpUtpaNZ7A\n\n\n
	\n\n\n\n\n\n\n🙌 Volunteer Sign-Up → https://forms.gle/15zMGTqZPSGKjGdy6 \n
	  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHave a love for Pokémon and want to be part of t
	he adventure? Bring your passion\, join the journey\, and let’s chat! 📩 \n
	From your first starter Pokémon to your latest collection addition\, Pokém
	on Mini Con celebrates every step of the Trainer journey. 🧢\n\nhttps://ccs
	-houston.com/events/pokemon-mini-con/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/pokemon-mini-con/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT7H
END:VEVENT
