UID:9OtP_VYP68eA848LqKHDd
SUMMARY:Artist Alley Houston IV
DTSTAMP:20260818T032834Z
DTSTART:20261010T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:Artist Alley Houston IV – Every Piece Has a Story Behind It\nSo
	mewhere in Houston\, an artist is finishing a print\, packing pins\, sewin
	g a plushie\, or putting the final touches on a project they’ve been excit
	ed to share for months. \nThis October\, those creations leave the studio 
	and head to Artist Alley Houston IV. \nFor one weekend\, artists\, makers\
	, and independent creators from across Texas and beyond will fill the floo
	r with original artwork\, fan creations\, handmade goods\, indie comics\, 
	stickers\, plushies\, accessories\, and all the things that start as an id
	ea and become someone’s new favorite piece. \n  \n📅 October 10-11 | 10AM –
	 5PM \n📍 9700 Bissonnet St\, Unit 1500\, Houston\, TX \n🎟️ FREE Entry + FRE
	E Parking \n  \n🔥 Event Highlights 🔥\n🎨 100+ Artists and Makers\nThe best 
	part? The artist is right there. Ask about their process. Talk about the f
	andoms that inspired them. Meet the people behind the work and discover cr
	eators you’ll be following long after the weekend ends. No AI-generated ar
	twork. No mass-produced imports. Just artists sharing the work they’ve cre
	ated themselves. \n  \n✨ Exclusive Drops and Event Debuts\nMany artists ar
	e launching event-only merch\, limited bundles\, brand-new releases\, and 
	first-time debuts created specifically for Artist Alley Houston IV. You wo
	n’t find these anywhere else\, online or in stores. \n  \n🛍️ Become a Guest
	 Vendor\nHouston creators – this floor is yours. Applications are open for
	 table spots at Artist Alley Houston IV. Every vendor is juried to keep th
	e floor 100% original and handmade. Apply Here → https://tinyurl.com/Houst
	onVendors \n  \n🎁 FREE Artist Raffle \nWin original art\, stickers\, keych
	ains\, handmade goods\, and more — generously donated by our featured arti
	sts. No purchase necessary. Just stop by\, sign up\, and celebrate the joy
	 of creativity (and maybe go home with something awesome). 🎁✨ \n  \n🏨 Stay
	ing the Weekend?\nA hotel block is available for out-of-town visitors and 
	creators making the trip. \nBook here 👉🏻 https://www.marriott.com/event-res
	ervations/reservation-link.mi?id=1767823967549&key=CORP&app=resvlink \n  \
	nDiscover a new favorite artist. Discover a piece that speaks to you. Disc
	over the story behind the work. \nWe’ll see you on the floor. 🎨✨\n\nhttps:
	//ccs-houston.com/events/artist-alley-houston-iv/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/artist-alley-houston-iv/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT31H
END:VEVENT
